<b>nakitai (nakenai)</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>泣きたい（泣けない）</b>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:31.800
<b>I want to cry (I can't cry)</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>soredemo</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>それでも</b>

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.380
<b>Even so,</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>shikatanai (kubomanai)</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>仕方ない（凹まない）</b>

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:34.970
<b>It can't be helped (Not feeling depressed)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>itakunai (youkumonai)</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>痛くない（痒くもない）</b>

00:00:34.970 --> 00:00:36.590
<b>It doesn't hurt (It doesn't itch)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>kowashitai (kowaretai)</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>壊したい（壊れたい）</b>

00:00:36.590 --> 00:00:37.970
<b>I want to break (I want to be broken)</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>yuzurenai omoi nara</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>譲れない思いなら</b>

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:41.640
<b>I don't want to surrender these feelings</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>chiratsuku kiiro shingou mushishite</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>ちらつく黄色信号　無視して</b>

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:47.400
<b>Just ignore that flashing yellow signal</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>kou kakudo de joushou chuu kokoro no flying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>高角度で上昇中　心のflying saucer</b>

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:53.030
<b>The flying saucer in my heart is rising at a sharp angle</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>nakanaka sunao ni nan nai himitsu no tobira ni keri irete!</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>なかなか素直になんない秘密のトビラに蹴り入れて！</b>

00:00:53.030 --> 00:00:59.870
<b>It kicks open that dishonest, secret door</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>chuugaeri de mata modotte kuru yo</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>宙返りでまた戻ってくるよ</b>

00:00:59.870 --> 00:01:03.080
<b>Do a loop-the-loop and return once more {Loop-the-Loop is the title of this song}</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>sakaraenai jiryoku mitai na omoi yo todoke!</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>逆らえない磁力みたいな思いよ　届け！</b>

00:01:03.080 --> 00:01:11.500
<b>Convey those seemingly irresistable magnetic feelings to you!</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>omote no kādo de shoubu shinai nande</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>表のカードで勝負しないなんで</b>

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:19.180
<b>You can't use a face card to decide the victory.</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>dare no tame no moraru?</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>誰のためのモラル？</b>

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:22.060
<b>Whose morals are those?</b>

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.440
Motto To LOVE-Ru 16

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:35.440
<u>Beach Girls</u>

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:39.700
Wow! Amazing! The sea is pretty!

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:40.950
You're right!

00:01:45.160 --> 00:01:46.870
The waves are awesome.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.630
The blue sky... The white clouds...

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:58.340
And me, Tenjouin Saki!

00:01:58.340 --> 00:02:02.430
Welcome to the Tenjouin Private Beach, everyone!

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:06.680
Hey! Listen to what I'm saying!

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:11.020
Who do you think brought you to this wonderful place?

00:02:11.020 --> 00:02:14.860
Please deliver your words of gratitude to Saki-sama.

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:17.610
Thank you very much!

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:21.160
You're very welcome!

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.040
Well then, enjoy yourselves fully!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.410
Take that... and that!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.810
Haruna-chan...

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:54.230
Hey, Rito. This is paradise, right?

00:02:54.860 --> 00:02:59.570
Lala-chan's figure is great, but Sairenji's thighs are really...

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:00.320
Oi!

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:05.240
Hey you! You come to the beach and that's the only thing you think of?

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:07.540
Who are you?

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:08.580
I'm Ren! Ren!

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:09.790
Hey, Ren!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:11.920
It's so hard to get Rito-kun right in front of us!

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.710
Hurry up and change with me!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.760
Quiet! It's my turn now. Just go to sleep obediently!

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.670
What was that?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.760
Hey, Yuuki-kun.

00:03:24.600 --> 00:03:27.720
Can you help me put this lotion on?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:29.730
Mikado-sensei!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:35.560
You're too innocent. You might want some physical training, right?

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:40.240
First up, skinship practice.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.320
Skinship?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.780
It's okay, you don't have to be afraid.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.660
Oshizu-chan.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:50.250
Yes, Sensei?

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:54.500
Got it!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:01.010
My body suddenly...

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.260
Well, hurry up.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.770
Focus Blast!

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.900
I envy you, Rito!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.860
I want to become your right hand!

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.490
Stop that, Murasame-san!

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.620
Honestly, even though you're just Mikado sensei's assistant...

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:34.460
My Focus Blast has gone berserk!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.080
Oh.

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:37.590
Flat-chested

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:37.790
Flat-chested

00:04:37.790 --> 00:04:38.540
Flat-chested

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:39.880
Flat-chested?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.180
Ah!

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:49.220
I'm sorry... that I'm flat-chested!

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.270
I didn't say that!

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:55.770
Everyone! How about we split some watermelons here?

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:58.110
Sounds like fun!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:06.910
I have trained hard specially for this day, improving my watermelon-splitting ability.

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:08.320
I'll show you!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.240
The watermelon-

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:12.160
Saki-sama!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:25.340
Yuuki Rito! You always, always...

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.050
What are you doing?

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.310
As usual, he's a pervert.

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:35.770
Honestly, it was hard getting these high quality watermelons. What a waste.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:37.810
It's your fault, Nana.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.360
Ah, that's right. Do you have a watermelon, Momo?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:42.650
Ah!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:48.160
Momo collects lots of plants and nuts from space, you know?

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:51.580
I have an edible watermelon from Watermelon planet, Onee-sama!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.710
Woah!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:04.630
How about this?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.140
Can you do watermelon splitting with this?

00:06:13.140 --> 00:06:15.680
Anyway, is that really a watermelon?

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:19.850
Don't worry. Since it's for food, it's obedient.

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.400
Mikan, what is "watermelon splitting"?

00:06:23.400 --> 00:06:26.570
Ah! Uh...

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:28.490
Will it be all right?{added this, TLC OMG -masat}

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.280
It's kinda scary...

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.780
But, I don't think it tastes nice.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.580
Hm. Maybe it doesn't.

00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:41.790
You can't say that! This one has a lot of pride.

00:06:43.340 --> 00:06:49.260
If you didn't know, common sense suggests that a good appearance has got nothing to do with its flavour.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:54.430
Furthermore, a monster watermelon that has pride? How impertinent.

00:06:57.730 --> 00:06:59.890
Calm down, Watermelon-san!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:00.480
Eh?

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:05.520
I'm all sticky...

00:07:05.520 --> 00:07:07.440
Saki-sama, hang in there!

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.450
Watermelon juice?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.660
Saruyama!

00:07:17.660 --> 00:07:18.290
Everyone!

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.120
Calm down, Watermelon-san!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.170
Hold it!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.750
If you cause any more trouble, I'll be your opponent!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.250
Ren-chan!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:35.430
Lala-chan, this is my chance to show you my manly side. Take this!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:39.220
My special move! Cyclone Grenade!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:41.230
Ren-chan!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:47.440
Hey, are you all right, Ren?

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.570
Run?!{added this -masat}

00:07:51.570 --> 00:07:57.370
We finally meet, Rito-kun. Rito-kun.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:07:59.040
Mikan!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.870
Let me go!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:08.130
Hey you! Let go of Mikan!

00:08:09.880 --> 00:08:11.630
Ow!

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:19.180
Lala-san!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.480
I can't take it anymore!

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:25.560
Lala-sama!{added this -masat}

00:08:26.230 --> 00:08:27.110
Sis!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.730
Watermelon-san! Please stop!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:34.240
Not my tail!

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.660
Sis! Eh- Momo?

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:42.200
I guess I have no choice but to use force.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.710
Stop it! Let go of Lala!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.420
Lala, are you okay?

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.630
Rito!

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:54.510
Hurry up and let go of Lala!

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.050
Yuuki-kun!

00:08:56.050 --> 00:08:57.760
It's dangerous! Get away from it!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:16.360
Is this the right way of playing this "watermelon splitting" thing?

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:21.830
You slashed it... It's a bit different from normal.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:26.960
This watermelon is really tasty.

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.580
It really is.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:33.170
What a relief. We managed to split the watermelon after all.

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:37.470
Sorry for causing you trouble. Everyone, would you like some more?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.050
I'll pass.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.970
Oh dear.

00:09:43.520 --> 00:09:44.350
Rito.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.350
Lala-sama, what's wrong?

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:52.150
It's nothing.

00:09:54.360 --> 00:09:56.110
By the way, where's Saruyama?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:15.760
Motto To LOVE-Ru 17

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:15.760
<u>Late Night Tutor</u>

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.880
Haruna, how did you do on the test?

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.050
Show me, show me!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.800
Wow! 98 percent?! Are you serious?

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:22.600
Hey, not in such a loud voice...

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:24.310
You're always amazing.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:26.270
Hurry and give it back!

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:29.650
If you don't play around properly, it's no good.

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.610
This is bad. This is really bad.

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:38.200
No matter what I do, I get this score. At this rate...

00:10:39.150 --> 00:10:43.490
Eh? Yuuki-kun is this dumb?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:48.870
I'm sorry, I hate stupid people.

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.170
Argh, this is bad! The retest is tomorrow!

00:10:52.170 --> 00:10:54.340
What am I going to do? What am I going to do?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:58.130
Anyway, if I don't study...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:00.340
I've got to get psyched up.

00:11:14.020 --> 00:11:15.980
How long were you going to stare for?

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.320
Sorry.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:22.360
Ah! That's-

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:26.700
I'll give it back.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.000
Just now... You were laughing at me, right?

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:36.170
If you can't do well in your studies, it's better to study with someone.

00:11:36.170 --> 00:11:39.340
This planet relies on knowledge.{TLC - pretty sure she said 勉強 人に教わるなり 動力したほうがいいのでは この星では学力が物を言うのでしょう}{I'd split this line but I won't touch this -masat}

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:44.680
You just happen to have someone close that can help you, right?{ちょうどう、身近に適任者がいるじゃないですか}

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:57.480
Lala... she was this smart?

00:11:57.480 --> 00:12:04.450
What are you saying now? Lala-sama is one of the greatest geniuses in the galaxy.

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:11.290
In the past, Lala-sama's family wanted to use her intelligence to create and develop all sorts of things.

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:15.670
But, recently when I asked her how she did on her test...

00:12:15.670 --> 00:12:20.800
That's when Lala was still learning about Earth.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.930
So it was because she couldn't read the questions?

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.760
Something like that.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:31.770
She's only good at making inventions that turn out to be pranks in the end. What a shame.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:35.940
Ah, I feel so much better now, Rito.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:38.520
Don't come in here with just a towel!

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.900
What's wrong? I'm not naked.

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.070
What is it? You're studying?

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:48.280
Yeah, but I don't have a clue on what to do.

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:49.530
Let me see...

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:55.040
Oh, this question?

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.580
What's wrong?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:01.550
It's okay if you teach me, but...

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.220
...at least, put something on?

00:13:04.220 --> 00:13:07.470
Eh? All right... Peke!

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.680
Yes!

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:35.580
This question... You need to use exponentials.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.790
Oh, I see. Then what about this?

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:41.590
That's a quadratic equation.{TLC - she says "しっすほうけいしき" and 方形式 (ほうけいしき) = square formula, but I have no idea what the first part means}

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:45.170
So you do it like this.

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:51.720
Oh! Amazing! You really are smart, Lala! Really amazing!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:57.600
Somehow, your compliments make me happy.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.610
Did you drop something?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.530
It's okay, it's okay.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:10.660
No, no. I have to focus!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:13.120
If I don't concentrate on studying...

00:14:14.120 --> 00:14:16.500
Err Lala? Your clothes-{added this, TLC OMG -masat}

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:17.540
Peke?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:20.790
Sorry, I'm out of power.{who didn't see THAT coming? -masat}

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:26.880
Anyway!

00:14:30.840 --> 00:14:36.180
Rito! You must be exhausted. I've brought... coffee.

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:45.440
I'm stu-stu-dying...{TLC please - this line is gibberish}

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:50.610
Keep working hard. I don't know what kind of study you're doing though...

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:53.410
This is a misunderstanding!

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:55.410
Retest

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:02.710
Damn it! I've forgotten everything I was supposed to remember!

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:03.960
Shut up!

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:14.430
Motto To LOVE-Ru 18

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:14.430
<u>Master of Love</u>

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.720
Rito!

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:16.640
Lala!

00:15:18.480 --> 00:15:21.100
Don't just grab me all of a sudden!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:22.650
Rito!

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:27.980
As usual, you haven't made any progress, right, Lala-chi?

00:15:28.820 --> 00:15:34.370
I thought you would know more about relationships.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.200
Relationships?

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.000
That might be true...

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:44.420
How should I appeal to Rito? I don't really know.

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:48.460
Anyway, I'll lend you something good today.

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:55.050
Here it is! The Relationship "How-To" Guide! Use this as a reference to get Yuuki!

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:58.350
With this... Rito...

00:16:03.770 --> 00:16:09.400
Relationships, huh? It sounds difficult, but I have to give it my best.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:11.150
Let's see...

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:17.370
First, invite him on a date! But, don't tell him it's a date!

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.250
The key point is to invite him out naturally!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.960
I see! All right.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.460
Rito!

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.300
What's the matter, Lala?

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:34.050
Um... Do you uh...

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:39.850
...want to go on a detour on the way home today?

